config ESP_MOSAICO_EXAMPLE_IRIS
    bool "Enable Iris USB services in the native example"
    default y
    help
        Start Iris before the first frame and report healthy after that frame
        is accepted. mosaico.py install waits for this. Iris also redirects
        stdout/stderr to its log service. Turn this off only for a UART
        console; the running game then cannot complete an Iris install.
